# Airsup20 isolation

`/airsup20` is a standalone slice. Keep it easy to delete.

## Put Airsup20 code only in
- `airsup20/` (routes, mcp, sql, oauth, services, endpoint, tools)
- the marked `AIRSUP20-BEGIN` / `AIRSUP20-END` blocks in `server/server.js`
- `"airsup20/**"` in `vercel.json` includeFiles

## Product rules
- No product website/dashboard — minimal Google consent only
- MCP: `https://www.tademehl.com/airsup20/mcp`
- Tools: `me`, `setup`, `update_listing`, `fulfill`, `get_inbox`, `get_trace`
- Layers: raw history, knowledge/facts, intents+evidence, listing (user projection), endpoint (our OpenAI), inbox
- Endpoint talk is our compute (fast `fulfill` path). Never Gmail-wake another ChatGPT. No chat widget.
- Trace every tool call with accurate spans from day one
- Tables are `airsup20_*` only — never share with `airsup_*` or diary

## Do not
- Import diary, admin, or `server/db/supabase.js` from Airsup20
- Add Airsup20 UI to other site pages
- Copy old Airsup people/Gmail/widget code into this slice

## Revert
```bash
node airsup20/revert-airsup20.js
```
See `airsup20/REVERT.md`.
